---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { COMPANY, CONTACT_EMAIL, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<Page title={`Privacy — ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Bioluma Labs collects no personal data: no accounts, no tracking, no ads.">
	<h1>Privacy</h1>
	<p class="lede">
		The short version: we don't collect your data. There are no accounts, no tracking and no ads,
		on this website or in our games.
	</p>
	<p class="updated">Last updated 23 September 2026</p>

	<h2>What we don't do</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>We don't ask for names, email addresses, ages or any other personal details.</li>
		<li>There are no accounts, logins or sign-ups.</li>
		<li>We don't use analytics, tracking pixels, advertising or third-party cookies.</li>
		<li>We don't show ads, sell anything inside our games, or share or sell data to anyone.</li>
		<li>There is no chat or messaging, and players can't contact each other.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>What stays on your device</h2>
	<p>
		Our games save things like progress, settings (such as sound on or off), unlocked characters and
		any names a player gives them. They save these in your browser's own storage on your device.
		That information never leaves the device and we can't see it. You can delete it at any time by
		clearing this site's data in your browser settings.
	</p>

	<h2>Hosting</h2>
	<p>
		This website and our games are served by Cloudflare. As with any website, Cloudflare handles
		basic technical information (such as your IP address and browser type) so it can deliver pages
		and protect the site from abuse. We don't use that information to identify, profile or track
		anyone.
	</p>

	<h2>Made for children</h2>
	<p>
		Our games are made for children, and we've designed them to need no personal information at
		all. If you are under 13, please ask a parent or carer to email us for you. If we ever receive
		personal information about a child by mistake, we will delete it.
	</p>

	<h2>If you email us</h2>
	<p>
		If you email us, we use your email address and message only to reply to you, and we delete
		them once they are no longer needed.
	</p>

	<h2>Questions</h2>
	<p>
		{SITE_TITLE} is a trading name of {COMPANY}, which owns and is responsible for this website and
		our games.
		If you have any question about privacy,
		email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
	</p>
	<p>If we change how any of this works, we'll update this page and the date at the top.</p>
</Page>
